{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/03/2980923/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伝わるだろうか...\nさゆにゃんと私が何をしてるのか\n伝わるだろうか..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はおかしかったー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/03/2980923/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでたー\nなんであんなに笑ったんだー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体育の小さいゲームで\n熱く盛り上がるほんの一部の中に私。\nはしゃぎすぎだろーう！ってい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんまりっか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/03/2980923/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶賛テスト勉強中でございます！\nいつまで内容薄いブログが続くと\n思ったら、、\n今週で終ーーーーわり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テスト終わったらやることリスト\n書いて、それに向けて頑張っておる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"理解できた。よ\nついでに数学も。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかパンッて出たらいいな。\n変わろう自分。ピカピカしてやる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/03/2980923/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「こてっ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のコメント嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/03/2980923/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会はまだかーーっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}